Third-party notice

This project is an unofficial, fan-made theme. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Mojang Studios or Microsoft.

The MIT license above covers the source code in this repository. It does NOT
cover Minecraft game assets.

Bundled Minecraft assets (not MIT):

  assets/sfx/*.mp3 — five Minecraft UI/game sound effects used for interface
  feedback (stonecutter click, chest open/close, firework launch, wooden
  door). They are the property of Mojang Studios / Microsoft, are included
  here only to make this fan theme sound like the game it pays tribute to,
  and are redistributed without a separate license from the rights holders.
  If you fork or republish this project, you are responsible for deciding
  whether you may keep these files; delete assets/sfx/ to fall back to the
  built-in synthesized sounds (the plugin keeps working, just less authentic).

NOT included, on purpose:

  - the Minecraft soundtrack (C418) and any other commercial music
  - additional Minecraft artwork / screenshots (only one base wallpaper,
    assets/wallpapers/cozy-cabin.webp, ships with the plugin)

See docs/OPEN-SOURCE.md for the full reasoning and how to swap assets in.
